  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate data in Dataverse environments with Camunda",
    "splashDescription": "The Microsoft Dataverse Connector is an integration solution that offers a variety of easily accessible operations that you can use to create, edit, and delete data in your Dataverse environments. The Connector enables you to view and customize table entries; it first requests an access token, then uses it to send an HTTP request to the Dataverse Web API. Through this method, the Connector enables you to use multiple configurable operations and customize its outputs to your specifications.",
